[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8942.95, "timestamp": "02:29:02", "text": "从比利开始，我开始不再"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8945.59, "timestamp": "02:29:05", "text": "不再那样做了，因为很难坚持下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8948.87, "timestamp": "02:29:08", "text": "记住每个人的名字，而且只有少数人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8951.03, "timestamp": "02:29:11", "text": "人们因为翻译而聊天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8954.15, "timestamp": "02:29:14", "text": "还有一些其他的东西，因为我看不懂中文。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8958.469, "timestamp": "02:29:18", "text": "呃，好痛。所以我想到的就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8960.469, "timestamp": "02:29:20", "text": "感谢大家，就此结束。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8963.11, "timestamp": "02:29:23", "text": "我应该像其他人那样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8965.83, "timestamp": "02:29:25", "text": "真的吗？现在可以了吗？将要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8968.469, "timestamp": "02:29:28", "text": "如果我不喊出来，大家都会难过的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8973.19, "timestamp": "02:29:33", "text": "你的名字，并跟我道晚安？就谢谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8975.67, "timestamp": "02:29:35", "text": "一般来说。好的。如果你们这么说的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8978.07, "timestamp": "02:29:38", "text": "好吧，行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8979.79, "timestamp": "02:29:39", "text": "并不是我不想做这件事，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8983.07, "timestamp": "02:29:43", "text": "除了“还行”以外什么都行"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8986.87, "timestamp": "02:29:46", "text": "美好的。你好。是的，谢谢大家。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8990.03, "timestamp": "02:29:50", "text": "今天就到这里。感谢所有到场的朋友们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8993.11, "timestamp": "02:29:53", "text": "在 Twitch 和 YouTube 上都有，以及那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8996.15, "timestamp": "02:29:56", "text": "正在关注这个板子并捕捉信息的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8999.59, "timestamp": "02:29:59", "text": "在直播中。谢谢。和"}]